chonk-dock: draw an evicted widget's dead tile without a second loan of the font system. The
RefMut loans taken in the scrutinee of `match self.items[index].render(..)` live until the end of
the match, and the None arm (the widget was evicted) borrows the same RefCells for
render_dead_tile: the dock panicked with "RefCell already borrowed" (raster.rs:192, from
Desktop::redraw_dock) the first time a widget was evicted. Under QEMU's emulation widgets block the
UI thread long enough to be evicted, so the dock died a minute after it started there.

